Explanatory notes related to XBRL : &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
In the General Info section, for the field Segment Reporting we have selected Single Segment though we have Multi Segments i.e B2B and B2C. When we are selecting Multi Segment in General Info Section, it is mandatory to fill in the  Segment Reporting tab or else there is validation error. However, as per para 4 of Ind AS 108 Operating Segments, the Company is required to disclose segment information only in the Consolidated Financial Results. Accordingly, disclosure of this information has been included under Consolidated Financial Results for the quarter ended 30th June 2025. To keep the XBRL aligned with published standalone results and avoid the validation error, we have reported the Single segment in Info Section and reported the Consolidated segment in Consolidated XBRL Results file. &lt;BR&gt; 
